{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406ecc34db1f17de3b5112d67246f0ecac5c3a2955b7e347d46bd5b4cac126da",
      "text": "错位的思绪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5238656be41edfc77c19a3b12cdc0f522ea383d41dd29a150a2c4aecdf4b5b",
      "text": "与受伤的悠介分开，享介独自迎战比赛。\n虽然他不断告诫自己悠介一定会回来，\n但却接连失误导致被换下场。\n在电视上看到享介这副模样的悠介，\n突然产生了一个念头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406ecc34db1f17de3b5112d67246f0ecac5c3a2955b7e347d46bd5b4cac126da",
      "text": "错位的思绪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cf6732ecb7f3ccada61363ed67237462959d3561a81635b3d16ccdfab41cfea",
      "text": "（今天的对手是连胜中势头正劲的队伍。\n必须打起精神严阵以待才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68",
      "text": "……唉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f79b1135a89d54f5e83d031b637a13bc747419fd18754fcb065cb74ac31dfc6",
      "text": "（平时都是和悠介一边开战术会议，\n一边走向球场的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a218ddd3aa65c1d4587fe4ca75a4fad360fff7ca92b6f05fbf7bbbd8a62169b",
      "text": "我不在的这段时间，球队的事就\n全拜托你了！放心吧，享介绝对没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3c668a3a8dd27ff92be44863d1b9185a526792cff3bf20a3b8626576ce746c6",
      "text": "我马上就会复出的，包在我身上！\n我们可是最强双胞胎啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21a2286912d0b098fae2b88b846452628047703cd616d95a1b923cc1cb6177f6",
      "text": "（……没事的。悠介绝对会回来的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:567cb556671ae07a974059ce19c0a608658e5f9cc9bb47c7d9be7c287f8d197f",
      "text": "（为了这个目标，\n他现在正在努力做康复训练）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8b06ddb76fa322aceb645f19d740700c5b1433ab86a3adb2b5127d3841a1f",
      "text": "为了悠介归来的时候着想，我也必须\n稳稳拿下胜利，提升球队的士气才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641c1cd5629530d7736d2ea8459cdf6cc4d5067a31ba97cad4ff1aaeb9b03fe2",
      "text": "（……可是，那会是什么时候？\n前阵子医生明明说暂时不要回球场）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0c35fb1cd222aec2b1885957dfd214a694f9375ac26bc0a7e7a90cfb2fe75",
      "text": "（……不行，比赛前不能胡思乱想。\n……但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
